This software ("the Software") is **Source-Available**, NOT Open Source (as defined by the Open Source Initiative).

1. **Free Non-Commercial & Personal Use**: If you are a solo individual, student, or academic researcher using and modifying the Software strictly for personal, educational, or non-commercial purposes, you may use, modify, and self-host the Software **free of charge** under **Part I (Non-Commercial Grant)** below.
2. **Commercial Use Requires Prior Agreement or Triggers Automatic Royalties**: Any Commercial Use (including selling the Software, offering it as a hosted/managed SaaS service, embedding it in a commercial product, or deploying it within any for-profit company, organization, or team of two or more individuals) **requires a separate written Commercial License from the Licensor BEFORE deployment**.
3. **Self-Executing Commercial Royalty Fallback**: If you or your organization engage in any Commercial Use of the Software without first executing a custom Commercial License Agreement with the Licensor, your Commercial Use constitutes irrevocable acceptance of **Part II (Default Commercial Royalty Terms)**, obligating you to pay **twenty-five percent (25%) of Gross Revenue or $2,500 USD per calendar month (whichever is greater)** to the Licensor. To obtain standard commercial pricing, contact the Licensor before commercial use.

